From 5f57e2032ea3bd88909239c757ab616a2859d911 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: root <root@core-ssh.local.hass.io>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 16:27:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Gardena Bluetooth product type discovery via proxies

Gardena devices often advertise the scan service UUID in the main
advertisement while manufacturer data arrives in scan responses. ESPHome
Bluetooth proxies and passive scanners may only forward partial data,
which led to "Unable to find product type" during pairing and migration.

Match active scans on the scan service, accumulate manufacturer data
across packets, and fall back to resolving the product type via a short
BLE connection probe when advertisements stay incomplete.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
